"""ITSG typed domain layer for the review assistant.

This is the typed-interface side of the system (agent-governance.md §2:
system agents operate only through scoped data and typed interfaces), kept
deliberately separate from the deterministic ingestion ``pipeline``
package. Contents mirror plan.md's minimal data contract and
architecture.md §5/§7/§9:

  states      - workflow state machine (retries never skip a gate)
  gates       - human gate decisions G0–G6 (audit records)
  records     - source/template/requirement/criterion/case/execution/finding/report/review
  store       - JSON store + append-only event log (plan.md: versioned JSON files)
  comparator  - deterministic PASS / MISMATCH / NOT_EVALUATED (fail closed)
  renderer    - mandated-form report rendering (stub)
  conformance - template conformance checks (fail closed)
"""

__version__ = "0.1.0"
